================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY OPEN-SOURCE & HARDWARE ATTRIBUTION NOTICE
================================================================================

Cub Spiele.Com is an independent, clean-room hardware emulator for the Sharp
SM8521 8/16-bit microcontroller architecture.

1. Non-Affiliation & Trademark Disclaimer:
   "Game.Com" and "Tiger Electronics" are registered trademarks of Tiger
   Electronics, Ltd. / Hasbro, Inc. "SM8521" is a trademark of Sharp
   Corporation. Cub Spiele.Com is an independent hardware preservation and
   emulation project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
   Tiger Electronics, Hasbro, Inc., or Sharp Corporation.

2. Hardware Documentation & Reference Implementations:
   - Sharp SM8521 8-Bit Single-Chip Microcomputer Data Book (Sharp Corporation)
   - MAME Project (`sm8500` CPU core & `gamecom.cpp` driver documentation by
     Wilbert Pol and contributors — BSD-3-Clause / GPL-2.0+)
   - RetroAchievements (`rcheevos` specification & Hardcore compliance standard
     — MIT License)

3. Third-Party Libraries:
   Full open-source dependency attributions and licenses (React, Vite, Electron,
   Tailwind CSS, Lucide Icons, Motion, fflate, Express, TypeScript) are listed
   in `credits.txt`.
